- * @t: Timespec
- * @inode: inode being updated
- *
- * Truncate a timespec to the granularity supported by the fs
- * containing the inode. Always rounds down. gran must
- * not be 0 nor greater than a second (NSEC_PER_SEC, or 10^9 ns).
